  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Sectorial Social: Argentina Avanza</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Sector Program: Argentina Forward</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos seran promover y apoyar el avance en la implementacin de los Objetivos de Desarrollo del Milenio, ODMs, por parte del gobierno de Argentina, as como apoyar al gobierno en cumplir sus compromisos financieros.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives will be to promote and support progress towards achieving the Millennium Development Goals , MDGs, by the Argentinean government, as well as to assist the government in meeting its financial obligations.</narrative>
  </description>
